{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-nibarosThirdAmbush-5459": "SOLDIER: 得撤了，但愿暴风雪能要了他们的命。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-nibarosThirdAmbush-5460": "SOLDIER: 发现敌人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5461": "ALEXANDRA: 我们……看到的是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5462": "ALEXANDRA: 他们是幽灵吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5463": "KORDYNE: 这里从没发生过这种事，否则我应该听说过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5464": "AGATA: 不可能是过去，技术太先进了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5465": "AGATA: 你们就是在这片地面上，举行去除魔法的仪式？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5466": "KORDYNE: 是的，仪式能生效，是因为这里仍残留着一些魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5467": "KORDYNE: 那是古代希纳尔文明留下来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5468": "BEN: 看！他们是需要帮助！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5469": "NIKOLAI: 不管得怎么做，赶紧——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5470": "NIKOLAI: 快，快，快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7start-5471": "NIKOLAI: 我们得尽量甩开军队，走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-cantLeavePass1-5472": "NIKOLAI: 后面只有麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bathosCaveNoBacksies-5473": "BEN: 已经说好，是走另外那边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5474": "NIKOLAI: 好，上次是怎么弄的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5475": "CORDELIA: 上回我可什么都没做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5476": "NIKOLAI: 该——小心！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5477": "NIKOLAI: 后面还会来更多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5478": "AGATA: 还能看见他们吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5479": "ALEXANDRA: 我们真有必要追上去吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5480": "BEN: 你不想知道吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5481": "AGATA: 我想再看清楚些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5482": "AGATA: 那些士兵，和魔法佬实验室传送门里的那些人一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5483": "ALEXANDRA: 谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5484": "AGATA: 说来话长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5485": "AGATA: 走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-secondShinariDoor-5486": "ALEXANDRA: 等等我们！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5487": "NIKOLAI: 不能留在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5488": "NIKOLAI: 爬上崖壁，怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5489": "JEROME: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5490": "NIKOLAI: 他们在炮击！找掩护！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5491": "NIKOLAI: 马特乌什！过来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5492": "MATEUSZ: 何必呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5493": "MATEUSZ: 世界不就是这样的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5494": "MATEUSZ: 有杀人的，也有被杀的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5495": "MATEUSZ: 你们全是杀人者，来自满是杀人者的国家，而我们兄弟俩生来就是受害者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5496": "MATEUSZ: 如果我注定要归于虚无，那为什么还要等？至少还能再和帕维尔团聚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-thirdShinariDoor-5497": "NIKOLAI: 门开了！走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5498": "NIKOLAI: 这位置挡步兵还行。可要是来了军官，或是架上重武器，咱们马上就麻烦了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5499": "NIKOLAI: 门的事，有头绪了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5500": "CORDELIA: 门由需要供能的开关控制。这种机关虽然古老，原理却很简单。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5501": "CORDELIA: 不过，有一点可以肯定：它绝不会自己启动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5502": "CORDELIA: 这里看不到开关，那些人一定在别处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5503": "NIKOLAI: 哪些人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5504": "AGATA: 那是支真正的军队，连火炮都有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5505": "AGATA: 我们已经……一个多世纪没见过这种军队了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5506": "AGATA: 准备好了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5507": "ALEXANDRA: 那个，呃……还要往前走多远？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5508": "AGATA: 不知道。不过，你不必跟来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5509": "ALEXANDRA: 没事了，抱歉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5510": "BEN: 他们为什么不看见那个机关？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthShinariDoor-5511": "AGATA: 也许很快就知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthDoorOpen-5512": "AGATA: 希望他们就在下面那扇门后。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthDoorOpen-5513": "JEROME: 他们不会已经放弃追赶了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthDoorOpen-5514": "NIKOLAI: 冯·罗尔盯着，就不可能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthDoorOpen-5515": "JEROME: 还是不知道帮忙的会是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthDoorOpen-5516": "NIKOLAI: 不知道。不过，奥斯伦军队的敌人可不少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-fourthDoorOpen-5517": "NIKOLAI: 走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-lastDoorScene-5518": "CORDELIA: 来得……真及时。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-lastDoorScene-5519": "NIKOLAI: 早到才叫准时。继续走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-lastBathosTransition-5520": "AGATA: 得追上他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosView1-5521": "嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5522": "AGATA: 错过他们了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5523": "BEN: 风里面，有声音。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5524": "BEN: 还有那个魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5525": "NIKOLAI: 看来暂时甩掉军队了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5526": "NIKOLAI: 暴风雪也小了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5527": "CORDELIA: 等等……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5528": "CORDELIA: 有人施了引路术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5529": "NIKOLAI: 别让军队知道我们在哪儿，他们会再开炮的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5530": "CORDELIA: 它不是让别人找到你，而是帮你找到别人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5531": "NIKOLAI: 那是……他们？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5532": "ALEXANDRA: 又能看见他们了，可他们是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5533": "AGATA: 更重要的是……他们在哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5534": "<align=\"center\">他们站在另一个世界。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5535": "KERAUNOS: 各位好，我叫凯劳诺斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5536": "NIKOLAI: 凯劳诺斯？你们两个认识他？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5537": "CORDELIA: 如果他真是自称的那个人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5538": "CORDELIA: 他是四位贤者之一，大战结束时，他们在尼巴罗斯山顶击败了科尔辛将军。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5539": "KERAUNOS: 正是在下，当时我确实在那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5540": "CORDELIA: 您说……有人在另一个世界？这是什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5541": "KERAUNOS: 这是个离奇的故事，要从近一百五十年前说起……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5542": "<align=\"center\">……那时，我与同伴站在圣山之巅。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5543": "HEIZER: 你自己也说了，此时此刻，元素的力量……魔法的力量，都汇聚在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5544": "HEIZER: 问题是……我们要怎么做？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5545": "KERAUNOS: 为什么非要做什么？魔法本来就是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5546": "KERAUNOS: 我们连它都无法完全理解，更别说改变它。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5547": "HEIZER: 你不会真这么想吧？看看科尔辛在这场战争中做成了什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5548": "HEIZER: 一个骤然发迹的边境领主，靠几手戏法，就差点征服世界！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5549": "HAELAN: 科尔辛的革新，可不只是几手戏法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5550": "HAELAN: 他执意挑起战争，令人遗憾，但他将魔法系统化的方法仍有许多值得学习之处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5551": "HEIZER: 正是！想想看，要是这力量掌握在合适的人手里！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5552": "LE DERNIER: 而你觉得，自己就是那个合适的人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5553": "HEIZER: 为什么不是？你成为哲学家，总不是为了把智慧藏着不给人看吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5554": "HEIZER: 你就不想用魔法重塑世界？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5555": "LE DERNIER: 纵观历史，魔法始终在加剧人类的苦难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5556": "LE DERNIER: 少数人利用魔法压迫大众，这场战争不过是又一个例子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5557": "LE DERNIER: 我宁愿看到一个没有魔法的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5558": "KERAUNOS: 那你不如连风雨也一并废除。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5559": "KERAUNOS: 没有魔法的世界，会是什么模样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5560": "HAELAN: 彻底放弃魔法，未免太过了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5561": "HAELAN: 何必走到那一步？先研究它、规范它，不行吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5562": "LE DERNIER: 好让监管者独揽力量？恕我不能赞同。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5563": "<align=\"center\">我们就这样争论了几个小时，始终没有结论。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5564": "<align=\"center\">分歧无法弥合，大家各自回了故乡。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5565": "<align=\"center\">可奇怪的事接连发生……魔法本身的性质，改变了。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5566": "<align=\"center\">我前往塞伦，寻找皮埃尔·勒德尼耶，希望他能解释发生的一切。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5567": "KERAUNOS: 你确定是这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5568": "MERCHANT: 塞伦就是围着这口古井建起来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5569": "KERAUNOS: 又一处希纳尔遗迹……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5570": "MERCHANT: 我家几代人，都往返阿科斯和塞伦做买卖。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5571": "MERCHANT: 我们以前在这口井边饮马，远处那些山丘我都认得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5572": "MERCHANT: 可城不见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5573": "KERAUNOS: 我的朋友皮埃尔，就住在这片广场附近。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5574": "MERCHANT: 您在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5575": "KERAUNOS: 我借给皮埃尔的书里，有几本被我织入了引路术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5576": "KERAUNOS: 现在还能感应到一丝……极其微弱的魔法痕迹……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5577": "MAN: 你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5578": "WOMAN: 他就那么……凭空出现了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5579": "MAN: 你还会魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5580": "KERAUNOS: 我叫凯劳诺斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5581": "KERAUNOS: “还会”魔法，是什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5582": "MAN: 怎么，世界末日你都错过了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5583": "KERAUNOS: 我从堤刻来，寻找一位住在这里的朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5584": "KERAUNOS: 这里是塞伦城，没错吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5585": "OLD MAN: 最好先找贝尔纳说说，不然怕要惹出……麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosArrivesPass-5586": "OLD MAN: 他应该就在上面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5587": "BARBARIAN: 你是谁？不让你进。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5588": "BERNARD: 好本事，不过我也要问同一个问题：你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5589": "KERAUNOS: 我叫凯劳诺斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5590": "BERNARD: 凯劳诺斯？你参加过战争吧？我在报纸上读过你的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5591": "BERNARD: 你怎么还会魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5592": "KERAUNOS: 我不明白这个问题，为什么我不该会魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5593": "BERNARD: 因为全世界都失去魔法了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5594": "BERNARD: 所有人！农民、军队、教师……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5595": "BARBARIAN: 我们所有的女医师和祭司。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5596": "KERAUNOS: 可在我的国家，魔法虽然发生了变化……却从来没有消失。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5597": "KERAUNOS: 我在找一位研究魔法的朋友，皮埃尔·勒德尼耶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5598": "KERAUNOS: 他的房子……应该就在这边？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5599": "BERNARD: 我们只能守住这片广场，出了这里，可能遇见匪帮，也可能遇见野兽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-bernardScene-5600": "BERNARD: 野兽的魔法还在，可我们已经没多少手段抵抗了，就祝你好运吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosAmbush-5601": "BANDIT: 嗯，拿他当奴隶可能不好用，不过贝尔纳肯定愿意花钱赎他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosAmbush-5602": "KERAUNOS: 最好再想想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosBoss-5603": "KERAUNOS: 也许你没看见，刚才你的同伙是怎么倒下的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosBoss-5604": "KERAUNOS: 那不是强盗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosBoss-5605": "KERAUNOS: 飞走了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5606": "MAN: 好吧……既然你还会魔法，这些东西我就不争了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5607": "KERAUNOS: 这所房子原来的主人在哪里？皮埃尔·勒德尼耶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5608": "MAN: 他叫这个名字？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5609": "MAN: 这一个来月，我们都在这些房子里搜东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5610": "MAN: 第一次来的时候，里面是有个人，可已经死了好一阵子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5611": "KERAUNOS: 他怎么死的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5612": "MAN: 说不好，没伤口，也不像饿死的，我想他是看见世道变成这样，自己了断了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5613": "MAN: 很多人都这样……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5614": "KERAUNOS: 离开尼巴罗斯山时，皮埃尔·勒德尼耶想要一个无魔法世界的愿望，已经实现了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5615": "ALEXANDRA: 等等，塞伦人都不会魔法，就因为……某个人不想让魔法存在了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5616": "KERAUNOS: 还不止如此，我并没有许下什么愿望，只是相信故乡智者的说法：魔法就像风一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5617": "KERAUNOS: 你不知道它从哪里来，也不知道它将往哪里去，而这种信念也造就了一个独立的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5618": "AGATA: 所以，本这样的人才会突然得到强大的力量？一切变得……随机？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5619": "NIKOLAI: 等等……那我们现在站在哪个世界？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5620": "CORDELIA: 不是刚才说的那两个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5621": "CORDELIA: 那天诞生的，不止两个世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5622": "CORDELIA: 一定是四个，每位贤者各自对应一个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5623": "CORDELIA: 战争结束后，莱奥尼亚的魔法曾发生过翻天覆地的变化。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5624": "CORDELIA: 大家一直以为，那是因为我们的魔法科学迎来了突破。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5625": "CORDELIA: 真正的原因一定是海兰·里德希望有一个魔法可以被研究、被掌控的世界，正是这个愿望，又创造了一个世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5626": "KERAUNOS: 这些年来，我也逐渐相信事情就是如此，只是直到在遗迹中看见你们的影像，才终于有了证据。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5627": "JEROME: 那么，我们的世界一定早就和尼古拉的世界建立了联系。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5628": "JEROME: 我们那里的技术，才会流入他所在国家的军队手中。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5629": "NIKOLAI: 所以，总理才有能力发动战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5630": "AGATA: 你们世界的军队……正在试着进入我们的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5631": "AGATA: 之前，我们在一个叛逃法师的传送门里，见过那些士兵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5632": "KERAUNOS: 是的，现在你们可以作出选择。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5633": "KERAUNOS: 若不愿战火蔓延到自己的世界，就必须帮忙阻止它。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5634": "AGATA: 怎么做？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5635": "KERAUNOS: 四个世界之间，有一样东西始终相同：古代希纳尔的遗迹，没有受到世界分裂的影响。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5636": "KERAUNOS: 其中最珍贵的遗物是一本名为《重写之书》的书，就存放在塞伦东北方的王家档案馆最底层。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5637": "KERAUNOS: 只要我们分别在三个世界里站到那本书旁边，我应该就能通过三角定位确定彼此的相对位置，到时就能帮助你们跨越世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5638": "KERAUNOS: 你们四个，必须回到勒德尼耶的世界，前往那里的档案馆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5639": "KERAUNOS: 我会去这个世界的档案馆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5640": "KERAUNOS: 至于你们……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5641": "CORDELIA: 我知道档案馆的大致方位，但要穿过尼巴罗斯山脉，就是另一回事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5642": "NIKOLAI: 西边不远其实有个村子，可以去问路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5643": "KERAUNOS: 等所有人都到达档案馆，我会再与你们交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5644": "KERAUNOS: 在那之前，祝各位好运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5645": "NIKOLAI: 好吧，看来又有任务要办了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-keraunosLight-5646": "NIKOLAI: 虽然我也没弄明白……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7end-5647": "要保存游戏吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7end-5648": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7.yarn-chapter7end-5649": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgBarb4-5650": "BARBARIAN: 想看清楚，可这里还有墙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgGuard2-5651": "OLD MAN: 幸好这些年，我打猎的本事还没丢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgGuard2-5652": "OLD MAN: 只是没想到，有一天这枪竟得用来对付一帮贼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgBarb3-5653": "BARBARIAN: 你要小心。这里的路，我们人不够守。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgGuard-5654": "MAN: 佩科先生的火药厂没恢复满负荷运转前，我们都得省着弹药。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgBarb2-5655": "BARBARIAN: 小心，外面别的部落不友好。里恩人的匪帮，更坏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgBarb1-5656": "BARBARIAN: 亲族回来之前，这条路不通。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sWater4-5657": "MAN: 要找吃的就别来问我了，粮食都由贝尔纳和他那些野蛮人每天统一分配。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sWater4-5658": "MAN: 话说回来，魔法消失以后，地里几乎什么都收不上来，现在能有口吃的就不错了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sWater3-5659": "WOMAN: 爸爸的农场……没魔法催着长，收成少得可怜，后来流民又来把什么都抢走了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sWater1-5660": "MAN: 我还以为牛能吃草，自己算走运，可饥饿的人群很快就找到了我的牛群……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sWater2-5661": "OLD MAN: 我们拿佩科工坊造的枪和其他东西，跟仅剩的几家农场换粮食。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodLine4-5662": "OLD WOMAN: 流窜的暴民来时，我和孙女在茅坑里躲了三天。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodLine4-5663": "OLD WOMAN: 幸好这里还在做肥皂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodLine3-5664": "GIRL: 真希望有人找到个好面包师带过来，总得偶尔吃点可露丽吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodLine2-5665": "OLD MAN: 我以前是钟表匠，现在他们肯给我饭吃，只因为我会做枪里的齿轮。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodLine1-5666": "WOMAN: 那些野蛮人让年轻姑娘干一点活就给吃的。我倒有点怕……他们图的是什么呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodManagerBarb1A-5667": "BARBARIAN: 你能拿多少，我们决定。记住。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodManager1B-5668": "MAN: 每个人都有自己的份，不许多拿，我们还不知道下一批物资什么时候到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodManagerBarb2-5669": "BARBARIAN: 只有偷食物，是死罪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodManagerBarb3-5670": "BARBARIAN: 这些留给明天。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-foodManagerA-5671": "MAN: 别乱伸手，补给经常断，我们得留些储备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire2-5672": "OLD MAN: 是欣族人把我从王家档案馆一路带到这里的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire2-5673": "OLD MAN: 他们想请我教自家的孩子，让他们跟塞伦的孩子一起上课，看来是打算在这里定居了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire3-5674": "BOY: 族人要我学习里恩人的机械和医术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire1-5675": "GIRL: 现在他们只想让我们学数学，可我想像妈妈一样当个画家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire4-5676": "YOUNG MAN: 城市东北方有个村子，那儿原本就没人能用魔法，可他们居然还有余粮能拿出来卖。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire4-5677": "YOUNG MAN: 所以，只要沿途没被流民或洪水堵住，我们就会组起商队，去那里买粮。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire5-5678": "WOMAN: 我以前是乐师，现在整天搬粮食、照料牲口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire6-5679": "OLD MAN: 我在教他们用更好的炉子，能省些燃料。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sCampfire7-5680": "GIRL: 现在想碰什么刀都可以了，以前可是要挨骂的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sWorkerDude-5681": "MAN: 我们的机器零件比食物多得多，这个聚落就是靠造东西活下去的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sForge-5682": "MAN: 这房子改成了锻炉和工坊，不在这里干活的人，不许进。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-bodyguardBarb1-5683": "BARBARIAN: 这里没有你要拿的东西。别惹事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-bodyguardBarb2-5684": "BARBARIAN: 不许打架。人已经不够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sPatrolBarb1-5685": "BARBARIAN: 我们的求雨人和女医师，都没了魔法，你还有？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-BernardDialogue-5686": "BERNARD: 幸好我们遇上了欣族人，如今这一片街区都靠他们保护。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-BernardDialogue-5687": "BERNARD: 魔法一消失，大多数农场就留不住地里的肥力了。庄稼生了病、招了虫，也没法治。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-BernardDialogue-5688": "BERNARD: 看来边地以外的日子也一样不好过，否则欣族人也不会一路来到这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-leftGuardBarb1-5689": "BARBARIAN: 这边夜里，有怪物嚎叫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-leftGuardBarb2-5690": "BARBARIAN: 我看过，一个大东西，夜里把人叼走。小心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgStreet1-5691": "MAN: 大部分空屋都被搜刮干净了，不过偶尔还能找到有用的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter7/chapter7npcs.yarn-sgStreet2-5692": "MAN: 我们花了几星期才替佩科找到拉膛刀头，有了它，步枪生意就归我们独家做了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3368": "Title: 寻找出路",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3369": "Description: 继续深入尼巴罗斯山口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3370": "Title: 命运转折的那一天",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3371": "Description: 了解凯劳诺斯所述往事的经过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3372": "Title: 四个世界……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3373": "Description: 前往山脉西北方的档案馆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3374": "Title: 四个世界……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3375": "Description: 越过风之门北方的渡河处，前往档案馆。"
}
